    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564-a1">

                <pb facs="0760" n="666" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg666"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 244.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Deposition of Walter W. Thompson.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">State of Florida</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">County of Munroe:</hi></p>
                <p>Walter W. Thompson, being duly sworn, deposes and says: That my name is Walter W.
                    Thompson; I reside in the city of Key West, State of Florida, and I am the
                    editor of the Key West Herald, a daily newspaper printed and published in said
                    city and county.</p>
                <p>I know Oscar Cespedes, and hare known him for twelve years, during which time he
                    resided in the city of Key West. Owing to the lack of authentic news from the
                    Spanish and Cuban war, I, as editor of said Key West Herald, engaged Mr.
                    Cespedes to go to Cuba and represent the said Key West Herald.</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Walter W. Thompson.</hi></p>
                <pb facs="0761" n="667" xml:id="pg667"/>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">State of Florida</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">County of Munroe:</hi></p>
                <p>The above statement is this day sworn and subscribed by Walter W. Thompson, to me
                    known to be the editor of the Key West Herald, a newspaper printed and published
                    in the city of Key West, County of Munroe, and State of Florida,</p>
                <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal.</hi>] <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >W. Hunt Harris</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Notary Public of the
                            State of Florida at Large.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>[Seal. Certificate of the Spanish vice-consul.]</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
